"""Музыка: a music service in large type, playing in the background.

Two sections, chosen in the header: the home (the house) shows rows of what
the service offers, Моя волна and its modes, one's collection, the chart,
new releases and picks, as covers to tap; Обзор goes through the service's
folders, one list at a time, and ← goes back. A tap only ever opens: music
starts when one taps a track in a list or «▶ Слушать» on a list or a radio.
A radio (Моя волна) plays on and on, fetching more as it goes, and its list
grows with it. The search field finds tracks. A heart on a track puts it
into Мне нравится or takes it out. The gear opens the settings: the sound
quality, the lowest unless chosen (~/.config/b8k/music.conf). The bar at the bottom shows the track
and holds its heart, back, pause and on, and the time bar seeks.

Pages opened stay built until one goes back past them, so ← is at once and
where one left it. The service's answers are kept in memory and on disk
(~/.cache/b8k-music/data.json): a page shows what was known at once and
asks the service again when that is older than a quarter of an hour. Covers
are kept on disk and, decoded, in memory.

Signing in shows a QR code to scan with the phone and a code to enter at
the service's page, whichever is easier.

The music goes on while other programs are in front; closing the window
(the shell's «Закрыть») stops it and quits. While it plays,
$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/b8k-awake/<pid>.suspend keeps the tablet from sleeping
when the screen goes off (b8k-sleep); the screen itself may go off.

Services are the sources package next to this file (or in
/usr/local/lib/b8k-music): Яндекс Музыка now, others the same way. Playback
is libmpv through python-mpv, sound only.
"""
